  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{-b}{2 a} < 5 \\\\\n& f(5)>0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow k \\in(-\\infty, 4) .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
